    "title": "Solar system 太阳系 [ 3D/4k/自定义]",
    "description": "”可以直接在屏幕上单击时间唤出滑块调整视角距离和角度！！！“\n\n如果遇到光照或者帧率不理想问题可以尝试：\n1.后处理选择禁用或启用而不是高，这张壁纸的表现并不依赖处理\n2.帧率60帧最佳，其余设置都可以让步降低\n\n此壁纸尽量在现实物理规律和艺术表达上做了平衡：\n1.采用圆形而非椭圆形轨道，轨道半径做了艺术化处理；\n2.天体的体积做了艺术化处理，但大小顺序没有变化 ；\n3. 行星和卫星的公转轨道倾角均与现实一致 ；\n4.天体的运行速度可以调节成和现实的太阳系各个天体的运行速度成正比关系，但我做了非线性和线性的变换，使之适于壁纸以作观赏（虽然可以调节，但我不建议调整 ）\n5.只是个简单壁纸，请勿被误导！\n\n理论上三个参数均为1时，系统内的天体运行周期会和现实的太阳系成倍速关系，但我不建议这么做，因为海王星天王星运行速度会极其微小的同时卫星却在疯狂运转。所以非必要请勿调整其中参数\n\n感谢订阅和点赞~\n有问题可以在此反馈，尽力修复。\n\nTranslation:\n\"You can now click the time directly on the screen to bring up a slider for adjusting perspective distance and angle!!!\"\n\nFor lighting or frame rate optimization:\n   1.Post-processing: Set to Disabled/Enabled instead of High (visual quality doesn't rely on post-processing)\n   2.Frame rate: Target 60 FPS as the priority. Other settings can be moderately reduced if needed.\n\nThis wallpaper strives to balance realism in physical laws with artistic expression:\n   1.Circular rather than elliptical orbits are adopted\n   2.Celestial bodies are artistically scaled while maintaining their relative size hierarchy\n   3.Orbital inclinations of planets and moons align with actual astronomical parameter\n   4.Celestial movement speeds can be adjusted proportionally to reality, but I've implemented nonlinear/linear transformations for optimal wallpaper aesthetics. Though adjustable, modification is not recommended.\n   5.This is merely a simplified wallpaper - please do not take it as an astronomical reference!\n\nTheoretical note: When the following three parameters are all set to 1, the system's orbital periods would maintain proportional relationships with our solar system. However, this configuration is strongly advised against, as it would result in Neptune/Uranus moving at imperceptible speeds while their moons rotate frenetically. Please avoid adjusting these parameters unless absolutely necessary:\n\n• Planetary angular velocity linear transformation\n• Planetary angular velocity nonlinear decay\n• Lunar angular velocity linear attenuation\n\nThank you for your support!\n If you encounter a bug during the customization process, please reset the wallpaper first and give me feedback;\n\n更新：\n2025/3/31 新增时钟、星期、及日期的大小，位置，颜色独立调整自定义功能\n2025/4/1 更新了视角距离和角度调整功能，可以直接在屏幕上单击时间唤出滑块调整，无需打开wallpaper engine调整，且调整更丝滑实时；\n2025/4/1 更新视角滑块位置和大小可调，新增了天体基本信息\n2025/4/2 修改了体积光在某些设备上不显示的bug：将太阳更换成了实体模型\n\n\nUpdate：\n2025/3/31Added independent customization features for adjusting the size, position, and color of the clock, weekday, and date.\n\n2025/4/1 Updated perspective distance and angle adjustment functionality. Users can now click the time directly on the screen to activate the adjustment slider, eliminating the need to open Wallpaper Engine. Adjustments are smoother and update in real-time.\n2025/4/1 Updated the perspective slider to allow adjustment of position and size; added basic information for celestial bodies.\n2025/4/2 Fixed a bug where volumetric lighting failed to display on certain devices by replacing the sun model with a solid 3D object.",
